  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Pr&#xed;spevok UNFCCC 2022</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFCCC Contribution 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Core budget contribution of the Slovak Republic to UNFCCC for 2022. The main aim of the convention is the protection of the environment against the negative impacts of the climate change.&#xa0;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;spevok SR do rozpo&#x10d;tu UNFCCC za rok 2022.&#xa0;Hlavn&#xfd;m zameran&#xfd;m dohovoru je ochrana &#x17e;ivotn&#xe9;ho prostredia pred negat&#xed;vnymi vplyvmi zmeny kl&#xed;my.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Financovanie n&#xe1;kladov spojen&#xfd;ch s fungovan&#xed;m konferencie str&#xe1;n dohovoru, fungovan&#xed;m podporn&#xfd;ch org&#xe1;nov dohovoru, st&#xe1;leho sekretari&#xe1;tu dohovoru a ostatn&#xfd;ch nevyhnutn&#xfd;ch n&#xe1;kladov.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
